{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19144","headline":"酬乐天扬州初逢席上见赠 · 刘禹锡","name":"酬乐天扬州初逢席上见赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巴山楚水凄凉地，二十三年弃置身。\n怀旧空吟闻篴赋，到乡翻似烂柯人。\n沈舟侧畔千帆过，病树前头万木春。\n今日听君歌一曲，暂凭杯酒长精神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19144.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19144","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、《全唐诗》卷三五九、《唐诗鉴赏辞典》刘禹锡条（上海辞书出版社，1983）、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}